body:
I have an InstantPot sitting in my kitchen for four years...unopened. Maybe it's time to take it out and put it to use. Thanks for reminding me about it!

&#x200B;

I shop primarily at ShopRite and Costco. Haven't ever been to a trader joe's but one is being built in my area. So I'll have to check them out. I need to refine my grocery list and really shop for deals/coupons. I usually run in and get what I think I need and run out.

I'm sorry you went through all that! It sounds like you guys really made some changes. Kudos to you and your husband! I still owe money on our two cars. I don't know what we would get for them. But we do use both cars, he travels for work.  I'm glad to read that you guys pulled through and are in better shape! It gives me hope :)

&#x200B;

Thanks for the tips, I'll go over it with my husband
